      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T21:21:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also, if you ignore the error here and simply not increment the count when there\u0027s an error, would the lack of sufficient plt entries cause a module load failure elsewhere? This error path seems unlikely enough that it might be clear to just let the other error patch catch the -ENOMEM issue.\n\nThat would also avoid a bunch of churn in other areas of this change.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 221,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 222,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "cc26229554d8e740c0ad292882b1fd3c467bb60a",
